{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國總統特朗普當地時間20日在白宮公開舉辦的記者會上，專門針對此前辭去英偉達行政總裁一職的黃仁勳公開發聲，明確表示非常期待他能夠回歸英偉達執掌業務。<strong>他在記者會上直接表態，我非常希望他能回來，他是全世界範圍內都排得上號的頂尖稀缺人才，沒有人能輕易替代他在英偉達的位置。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587378.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.703389+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:13:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_hash":"1ad6d72e0374a233526ee4cafe6a08d12f01494a43c2e5be9697aea8e9d61e1b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}